From 7d7911b43e2908bf3b4da7f8886bfd03ac12f8a9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 3 Oct 2026 09:28:22 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(mcp): ingest announcements from all 15 NTPU offices

Register every office that publishes announcements on new.ntpu.edu.tw
(site keys confirmed against the live API on 2026-10-03). Announcements
cross-posted to several offices are stored once per office under a
unit-prefixed stable key; migration 0003 re-keys existing ORD rows.
Publishing is batched per page to stay under D1's 100-parameter and
per-invocation query limits, and the cron now runs one due office every
10 minutes. Search merges cross-posted items and lists postedBy;
get_announcement accepts an optional unit.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01FCgoUnzqQSfKjvqShB2hjh
